#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# subtract_sides

#% text
# `subtract_sides(rel, c)` subtracts c from every side of the equation or inequality rel.

#% text
# `subtract_sides(rel)` subtracts the right side: `rel(lhs - rhs, 0)`.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
subtract_sides(x + 3 == 7, 3)
#% output
#= x == 4

#% cell
subtract_sides(a*x^2 + b*x == c)
#% output
#= -c + a*x^2 + b*x == 0

#% cell
subtract_sides(x + y > 1, y)
#% output
#= x > 1 - y

